// Open sea in the vessel's world frame (metres, +X bow, +Z beam, Y up). Everything is a pure
// function of scroll progress: no clock, randomness or animation loop. The hull is fixed in this
// frame, so the water streams aft at SHIP_SPEED while the Kelvin wake stays steady, as it does for
// a real ship. Look: deep-water body colour lit mostly by sky reflection, a directional swell under
// wind waves, wind-gust patches, sparse sun sparkle on facets that happen to face it, and a quiet
